<title>USA: Eastern Environmental unit gets contract.</title>
<headline>Eastern Environmental unit gets contract.</headline>
<dateline>MT. LAUREL, N.J. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Environmental Services Inc said that a unit has been awarded a three-year, $7.8 million contract by the Cherry Hill Township in New Jersey for curbside trash and recyclables collection.</p>
<p>The contract was awarded to Super Kwik Waste Services of Voorhees, N.J., which it acquired in September. The contract covers service to 24,000 residential customers.</p>
